---
description: Go/Gin API development skill
---
# Go + Gin Skill
- Use Gin for HTTP routing (github.com/gin-gonic/gin)
- Project layout: cmd/api/main.go (entrypoint), internal/handlers, internal/middleware, internal/services, internal/repository
- Use context.Context propagation in every handler/service
- Use struct tags for binding/validation (binding:"required" on DTOs)
- For SQL: prefer database/sql + sqlx, parametrize ALL queries, no string concat
- Errors: return wrapped errors (fmt.Errorf("...: %w", err)), not panics
- Tests: use net/http/httptest + table-driven tests; place *_test.go alongside the package
- Ralph Loop: `go build ./...`, `go test ./...`, `go vet ./...`
